  "label": "Sarcastic Meme Format",
  "description": "The meme uses a three-panel format with escalating text ('free stuff!', 'more free stuff!', 'even more free stuff!') to create a comedic or mocking effect. This format relies on background knowledge of internet meme culture, where repetition and escalation are used to emphasize a point or to parody a situation. The sarcastic tone is implied by the juxtaposition of earnest political figures with the trivializing phrase 'free stuff!', which requires understanding of meme conventions and satire.",
